{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Live Photo Wallpaper Maker+ 可把任何影片轉成動態鎖定螢幕桌布，亦可直接挑選數百款現成素材，省去自行製作的工夫。無論想自製專屬畫面，或快速套用壁爐、海洋等動態場景，只要在鎖定螢幕長按即可播放。原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自製動態桌布與現成素材</h2>\n<p>用戶可從相片圖庫挑選影片，拖曳選取所需秒數，最長支援 10 秒，官方建議桌布以 1 秒為佳，裁切成直向滿版後儲存為 Live Photo，即可在設定或相片設為鎖定螢幕桌布。應用內建數百款現成動態桌布，涵蓋壁爐、水族館、海浪、珊瑚礁、森林、銀河與聖誕場景，可按最新或熱門瀏覽。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-507-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-508-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-509-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-510-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-511-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Live Photo Wallpaper Maker+</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:58:00.948824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}